# Deployment

- Local: `make infra-up` → `make migrate-up` → `make run` (see `docs/deployment/local.md`).
- Image: multi-stage distroless nonroot; never bake `.env` into layers.
- Release order: build → migrate up → roll API → smoke health/auth/public.
- Document new env vars in `.env.example` without real secrets.
- Checklist: `docs/deployment/checklist.md`.
